Gabi, acorde, vá embora!

1127
01:23:40,165 --> 01:23:41,166
Gabi!

1128
01:23:44,753 --> 01:23:46,338
Foda -se, telefones celulares!

1129
01:23:52,928 --> 01:23:55,222
João ...

1130
01:23:55,347 --> 01:23:56,306
João!

1131
01:23:57,307 --> 01:23:58,225
João!

1132
01:23:58,350 --> 01:24:01,353
Gabi! Gabi! Por
favor, acorde! Gabi!

1133
01:24:01,478 --> 01:24:02,479
Acorde!

1134
01:24:40,851 --> 01:24:41,852
João!

1135
01:24:47,191 --> 01:24:48,400
João?

1136
01:24:56,158 --> 01:24:57,367
João.

1137
01:26:20,867 --> 01:26:21,952
Onde está Nadia?

1138
01:26:22,077 --> 01:26:23,829
